<title>JAPAN: India tenders to buy August crude oil - traders.</title>
<headline>India tenders to buy August crude oil - traders.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>State-owned Indian Oil Corp (IOC) has issued its regular monthly crude oil tender, traders said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Traders said the tender, to cover one million barrels worth of India's regular spot crude needs for the month of August, will close on June 25 with offers valid until 10 p.m. local time (1630 GMT) on June 26.</p>
<p>North Sea, African, Middle Eastern and Pacific region grades are eligible for the tender, they said.</p>
